    Harness: waitFor bounded-polling predicates replace run.js settle-sleeps (#35 slice)
    
    - common.js: waitFor(page, pageExpr, {timeoutMs, intervalMs, description})
      polls every 25ms (2s default) and throws a named timeout carrying the
      last value; waitForPopover / waitForPopoverGone predicates on top.
    - run.js: 15 mechanical settle-sleeps converted (chord-click -> popover
      open; submit -> popover closed). Sleeps kept where a following check's
      failure semantics depend on them (:55/:72 re-renders, :79 banner-#31,
      :86/:198 same-condition checks, :211/:278/:282 Escape + fail-soft).
    - Coverage-neutral by design; full suite 8/8 green
      (artifacts/wave-2026-09-15/suite-35.log). F4/F5 slices remain on #35.

